{"4946100":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"SIDExLINES","steam_appid":4946100,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5081330],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIDExLINES is a blackjack roguelike deck builder where a well-stacked hand can bring down the house.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/7e9419bc18e742faa47a5fd4bb833dbc.poster.avif?t=1793753991\" width=1170 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/7e9419bc18e742faa47a5fd4bb833dbc.webm?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/7e9419bc18e742faa47a5fd4bb833dbc.mp4?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play blackjack solo or with friends. Chain unique side bets and altered cards into dynamic combos and builds. Every table sets a wager you have to clear.  The further you go, the harder the house pushes back. You'll need every edge you can get to beat pit bosses, clear the final stake, and walk out with the big win.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/e4a26fa191284ee51b59298f5b744566.poster.avif?t=1793753991\" width=1170 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/e4a26fa191284ee51b59298f5b744566.webm?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/e4a26fa191284ee51b59298f5b744566.mp4?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between tables, spend big in the shop to power up your wagers:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ side bets, each with its own effect, and 4 modifiers that stack extra benefits on top<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 playing card modifiers with compounding payoffs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice for 16 possible rewards that reshape your deck, bets, and economy <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 upgrades that level up the blackjack hands you rely on<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 table perks, each a permanent buff for the rest of the run<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/90729d7d545031efd3b92cc84866b0e7.poster.avif?t=1793753991\" width=1170 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/90729d7d545031efd3b92cc84866b0e7.webm?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/90729d7d545031efd3b92cc84866b0e7.mp4?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run deals a different game:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge modes - daily runs, curated rulesets, and a builder for making and sharing your own<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run it back - replay any run from its seed and chase a better outcome<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited possibilities - one card, one bet, one roll, one perk can change everything<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boons &amp; banes - discover 11 charms with powerful bonuses and 8 difficulty tiers to pick from each run<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless runs - take a victory lap past the final stake and see how far you can push your wagers<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/5ec6841b74c23c59de729eb534e3dcdc.poster.avif?t=1793753991\" width=1170 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/5ec6841b74c23c59de729eb534e3dcdc.webm?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/5ec6841b74c23c59de729eb534e3dcdc.mp4?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIDExLINES is a blackjack roguelike deck builder where a well-stacked hand can bring down the house.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/7e9419bc18e742faa47a5fd4bb833dbc.poster.avif?t=1793753991\" width=1170 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/7e9419bc18e742faa47a5fd4bb833dbc.webm?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/7e9419bc18e742faa47a5fd4bb833dbc.mp4?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play blackjack solo or with friends. Chain unique side bets and altered cards into dynamic combos and builds. Every table sets a wager you have to clear.  The further you go, the harder the house pushes back. You'll need every edge you can get to beat pit bosses, clear the final stake, and walk out with the big win.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/e4a26fa191284ee51b59298f5b744566.poster.avif?t=1793753991\" width=1170 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/e4a26fa191284ee51b59298f5b744566.webm?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/e4a26fa191284ee51b59298f5b744566.mp4?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between tables, spend big in the shop to power up your wagers:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ side bets, each with its own effect, and 4 modifiers that stack extra benefits on top<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 playing card modifiers with compounding payoffs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice for 16 possible rewards that reshape your deck, bets, and economy <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 upgrades that level up the blackjack hands you rely on<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 table perks, each a permanent buff for the rest of the run<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/90729d7d545031efd3b92cc84866b0e7.poster.avif?t=1793753991\" width=1170 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/90729d7d545031efd3b92cc84866b0e7.webm?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/90729d7d545031efd3b92cc84866b0e7.mp4?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run deals a different game:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge modes - daily runs, curated rulesets, and a builder for making and sharing your own<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run it back - replay any run from its seed and chase a better outcome<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited possibilities - one card, one bet, one roll, one perk can change everything<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boons &amp; banes - discover 11 charms with powerful bonuses and 8 difficulty tiers to pick from each run<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless runs - take a victory lap past the final stake and see how far you can push your wagers<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/5ec6841b74c23c59de729eb534e3dcdc.poster.avif?t=1793753991\" width=1170 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/5ec6841b74c23c59de729eb534e3dcdc.webm?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/extras\/5ec6841b74c23c59de729eb534e3dcdc.mp4?t=1793753991\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"SIDExLINES is a blackjack roguelike deckbuilder where synergistic side bets and card combos are how you clear rising wagers and survive run-ending pit bosses. Play solo or with friends and try to take down the house.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4946100\/51e183046b9a67d219fc2d7357483f38cd84afb6\/header.jpg?t=1793753991",